{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212090","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121209001:1":{"text":"You must have a death wish! You're no match for our secret weapon.","source_cn":"你们是来送死的吧！你们根本不是那个人的对手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1224BB253FF6146A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121209002:1":{"text":"Oh? Tell me more.","source_cn":"哪个人？你详细说说？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A4ECD659E650F29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121209003:0":{"text":"I won't waste words on a corpse!","source_cn":"我懒得和尸体多费口舌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF95F3D637E011F17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121209004:0":{"text":"Quit dreaming. We're alive and well, thank you very much.","source_cn":"别做梦了，我们绝对不会让那种事情发生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9770BE217912F6EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121209005:1":{"text":"But these guys are pretty tight-lipped. We need to come up with an alternative to brute force if we want information.","source_cn":"不过这帮家伙嘴还挺硬，我们得想个别的办法。要打探情报的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDC572EE1D33DF93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1121209005":{"text":"But these guys are pretty tight-lipped. We need to come up with an alternative to brute force if we want information.","source_cn":"不过这帮家伙嘴还挺硬，我们得想个别的办法。要打探情报的话，不能硬来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDC572EE1D33DF93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121209006:1":{"text":"Not a bad idea!","source_cn":"不错的建议！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD8B907FF97B65CDC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Not a bad idea!","female":"Not a bad idea!","variant_male_record_index":"117039","variant_female_record_index":"117040","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121209008:0":{"text":"I think we can pull it off. As for the clothes, leave it to me. I'll be back soon.","source_cn":"这方法估计行得通。至于衣服的事，好办，交给我。我很快回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF5FE87D9767E4CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1121209009:0":{"text":"Soon, Valen returns with Syndicate uniforms.","source_cn":"没多久，维伦带回了黑金商会的制服","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x852847787CF6F9B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121209010:0":{"text":"Here, try this on.","source_cn":"搞定了，